<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak forex trade turnover rebounds in Sept - NBS.</title>
<headline>Slovak forex trade turnover rebounds in Sept - NBS.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total foreign exchange trading in Slovakia rose to $6.86 billion in September from $4.99</p>
<p>billion in August, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK FOREX TRADING    SEPTEMBER     AUGUST	 JULY</p>
<p>(in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>  overall		     6,862	   4,993	 6,150</p>
<p>  USD trading		 4,559	   3,320	 3,926</p>
<p>  DM trading		  2,028	   1,516	 2,032</p>
<p>  other currencies	    275	     158	   193</p>
<p>TRADING IN USD</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix	     142		83	    57</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   3,888	   2,846	 3,664</p>
<p>  at foreign banks	    529	     391	   205</p>
<p>  total			 4,559	   3,320	 3,926</p>
<p>TRADING IN DM</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		31		95	    21</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,768	   1,326	 1,928</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 229		95	    83</p>
<p>  total			 2,028	   1,516	 2,031</p>
<p>TRADING IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     238	     113	   158</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  36		45	    35</p>
<p>  total			   275	     158	   193</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF USD TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		10		20	     5</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	   1,201	     879	 1,163</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 199	     136	    76</p>
<p>  total			 1,410	   1,035	 1,244</p>
<p>TOTAL NUMBER OF DM TRADES</p>
<p>  with NBS at fix		 5		24	     4</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     985	     730	   962</p>
<p>  foreign banks		 177	     115	    73</p>
<p>  total			 1,167	     869	 1,039</p>
<p>TOTAL  NUMBER OF TADES IN OTHER CURRENCIES</p>
<p>  at Slovak banks	     367	     197	   249</p>
<p>  foreign banks		  65		64	    62</p>
<p>  total			   432	     261	   311</p>
<p>Note: All dollar figures are rounded off.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
